menu "Locker RS485 lock panel timing"

    config LC_RS485_REPLY_DEADLINE_MS
        int "Reply deadline (ms)"
        range 100 10000
        default 1500
        help
            Longest wait for a complete reply, measured from the write. After
            it an unlock is reported as outcome unknown; it is never retried.

    config LC_RS485_QUIET_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Quiet interval (ms)"
        range 2 1000
        default 25
        help
            Silence between bytes that ends a frame. Must be several byte
            times at the configured baud rate.

    config LC_RS485_SETTLE_PERIOD_MS
        int "Settle period after a failed exchange (ms)"
        range 100 60000
        default 3000
        help
            Silence kept before the next request once a request got no usable
            reply. Bytes received in it are discarded. Must exceed the worst
            reply time of the panel, which is unmeasured until hardware check
            HW-A9.

    config LC_RS485_FAILURES_BEFORE_COOLDOWN
        int "Consecutive failures before a cooldown"
        range 1 255
        default 5

    config LC_RS485_COOLDOWN_MS
        int "Cooldown (ms)"
        range 1000 3600000
        default 60000
        help
            Time during which nothing is written after repeated failures.
            An unlock requested in it is reported as not sent.

endmenu
